  portrait: {fileID: 6732904177202368728, guid: 9ae6dc508789a344ea8ff26ced171111, type: 3}
  experience: 10
  dialog: 'Hey you! Name''s Edvin. You''re the new foreman right? A right sorry sod
    you are. The higher ups have been offering me your new position for years, but
    the difference between you and me is that I''m smart enough not to put myself
    in your now hopeless position. Well your new job is to send us into those dangerous
    caves, so get on with it! Just send me to A1 unless you wanna end up like the
    guy before you. '
